<title>ESTONIA: TALLINNA SIGNS LOAN AGREEMENT MAY 12.</title>
<headline>TALLINNA SIGNS LOAN AGREEMENT MAY 12.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Pank will sign a 50 million German mark syndicated loan agreement on May 12 in Frankfurt, the bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Tallinna Pank said earlier that it increased its syndicated loan sum to 50 million German marks, because the loan was oversubscribed by 28.5 million German marks.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
